<%#
  The image-upload behaviour for the crop-photo and saving modals is two
  modules, published on every page by studio/alpine_scopes:

    cropPhotoModal()          studio/cropper: x-data for studio/modals/_crop_photo
    imageUploadHost()         studio/image_upload: a crop-then-save uploader
    submitFormWithProgress()  studio/image_upload: a Turbo submit behind the
                              saving card, with a toast at the end

  THIS PARTIAL RENDERS NOTHING. It stays so an app that renders it by name gets
  no missing-template error. Cropper.js itself loads through
  studio/_cropper_assets on the pages that can open the cropper.
%>
